    {"t": "Select the correct form: 'I can't help ___ at his jokes.'", "o": ["to laugh", "laughing", "laugh", "laughed"], "a": 1, "e": "'Can't help' is followed by the gerund 'laughing'.", "d": 2},
    {"t": "Choose the correct option: 'It is no use ___ over spilt milk.'", "o": ["cry", "to cry", "crying", "cried"], "a": 2, "e": "'It is no use' is followed by the gerund 'crying'.", "d": 2},
    {"t": "Select the correct form: 'He is used to ___ late.'", "o": ["work", "working", "worked", "works"], "a": 1, "e": "'Be used to' is followed by the gerund 'working'.", "d": 2},
